# Text files are stored and checked out with LF line endings, whatever core.autocrlf says.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact copies of original resources extracted by tools/th10extract. Tests compare
# them with th10.dat / th10c.dat (e.g. gamedata/presentation_test.go reads musiccmtt.txt),
# so git must never normalize their line endings.
assets/** -text
assets/*.go text eol=lf
